  "caption": {
    "hashtags": [],
    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "Healing didn’t always look dramatic.⁠\n⁠\nSometimes it looked like saying no.⁠\nLike walking away from what kept hurting.⁠\nLike resting without apologizing for it.⁠\n⁠\nAnd sometimes it was quieter than that—⁠\ntrusting yourself again.⁠\nListening to the voice inside you that knew the way forward.⁠\n⁠\nMost of the time, healing doesn’t arrive all at once.⁠\n⁠\nIt happens in small choices.⁠\nQuietly.⁠\nUntil one day you realize how far you’ve come.⁠\n⁠\nxx Atticus⁠\n⁠\nSave this for the days you need the reminder 🖤",
    "word_count": 84
  },
